{"version":1,"key":"article:88","content":{"id":88,"title":"CSS @layer","author":"","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"450d258f-f72e-480d-afff-44f6a67c150b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在真实开发中，我们经常会受困于 CSS 的优先级问题。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"e4a1ad67-e42f-4aa3-875b-d531d937f8ad","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"比如我们使用了一个第三方库，但是第三方库的样式不符合我们的要求，我们想进行修改，为了修改成功，要么我们需要以更高的权重覆盖库的样式，又或者通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"!important"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 强行将优先级调到最高，后续在别处又要覆盖此处的优先级时，只能使用权重更高的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"!important"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，如此反复，我们很难知道最终到底是哪个样式在起作用。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"391cc5c6-1760-4956-b311-c0bc4a157ab1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"另外，CSS 规则的最终级联结果还受到资源加载顺序的影响，不同的加载顺序会对最终的样式造成不同的影响，所以我们必须要严格按照某种顺序加载 CSS 样式才能达到我们预期的效果，这种顺序的维护是比较脆弱的，因为如果后续引入新的样式，我们都需要保证新样式插入到正确的位置以保证没有问题。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"44bfbf73-2a2e-46ff-b662-b5e2a07cc2bc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"基于这个背景，CSS 规范引入了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"@layer"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 规则，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"@layer"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以将样式组织到不同的"},{"type":"formatted","textGradient":"ocean","bold":true,"text":"级联层"},{"type":"formatted","text":"中，并为这些层建立明确的优先级关系。因此，我们可以将第三方库放入较低优先级的级联层，再在更高优先级的级联层中编写覆盖样式，而不必不断提高选择器权重。"}]},{"type":"header","disableDrag":false,"level":2,"collabId":"3ee6fc84-066e-4ca9-bb6a-d1c6a9897ae9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"语法"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"c0d78a0b-3247-4dbc-bd5e-eaf0ae20a182","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 CSS 中，我们通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"@layer"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来声明一个级联层，根据是否有名称可以分为命名层和匿名层："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"aa407127-02d2-4582-b88e-191988df9859","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"7ffc99c6-4e27-400a-83aa-c85f8118b871","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"0ae2a9b9-dd7b-448a-87db-08ed820a0ab5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"命名层，可以包含语法块，也可以不包含"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"4e3ee819-3257-42b1-8880-823cb6aa46b0","collabId":"4bca82ba-9ae3-4ba1-bf82-6e6e1c1b40a4","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"@layer layer-name;\n@layer layer-name {\n  .btn {\n    color: red;  \n  }  \n}"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"d7622502-166c-4544-a47d-1dbcfd0500ef","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"也可以一次性声明多个级联层，级联层之间使用逗号分隔"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"debb071a-65d7-4023-8c91-a6ff794fd65d","collabId":"0d3feae8-7c10-45d6-b607-de65fabc2da1","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"@layer reset, components, layout;"}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"25c9c76d-8607-4cbe-9618-646d83301199","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"534c7967-84cc-4b7c-a00d-1840950d9e0c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"匿名层，只有语法块，没有名称"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"998625c6-2d44-437f-b280-b5c86f14c47d","collabId":"7b8f363f-8775-45fd-afb9-92988fbc031a","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"@layer {\n  .btn {\n    color: blue;  \n  }  \n}"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"a7bdb913-244a-48c4-9a51-5d8e7d773042","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于命名层，多次声明的相同名称的级联层是同一个 级联层"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"50f43b8c-690b-4202-a563-55716b739ee4","collabId":"a69ef31d-4612-4123-9453-53c19363be27","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"@layer components {\n  .button {\n    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n  }\n}\n\n/* 仍然是同一个 components 层 */\n@layer components {\n  .card {\n    padding: 1rem;\n  }\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"cde5f3ab-dce7-44b8-9233-bea0baab4596","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是对于匿名层，每次都会创建一个新的级联层"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"48849239-c778-47a7-ad1f-958eb9066e87","collabId":"8915db09-70b2-4e31-96b6-47d703f05059","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"@layer {\n  .button {\n    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n  }\n}\n\n@layer {\n  .card {\n    padding: 1rem;\n  }\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"385d13ed-b8c7-4b71-bba2-7237722be733","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"级联层还可以进行嵌套"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"03e2029e-ab58-4c74-ab41-d4c94c892a54","collabId":"570dab28-f9a8-4cf9-8517-f274a6c177e3","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"@layer framework {\n  @layer reset {\n    button {\n      appearance: none;\n    }\n  }\n\n  @layer components {\n    .button {\n      padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n    }\n  }\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"83807c84-10b5-48e7-b4c0-f569440c94d4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"也可以通过点号定义嵌套级联层"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"51d2b6f3-07a0-439b-9437-2e35238ba7cd","collabId":"c85fc417-483f-497f-b28f-9d3e1ec2ded0","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"@layer framework.components {\n  .card {\n    padding: 1rem;\n  }\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"99094927-a532-428d-bc43-b4362303fb96","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"除了通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"@layer"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来定义级联层，还可以在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"@import"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来导入样式的时候指定级联层"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"84dacd21-44a6-43ed-be89-e477f9ee54b6","collabId":"dae0cc1c-d0c7-444b-b48a-0f3d43e0dcb8","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"@import url(\"./normalize.css\") layer(reset);\n@import url(\"./component-library.css\") layer(vendor);"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"b4153daf-9ddd-4dab-b129-4f85c9ce1662","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"也可以导入到嵌套级联层"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"ba91d427-c612-4505-899f-afce088e3ef8","collabId":"382b3eed-860f-4bf9-be01-2bb19f83233c","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"@import url(\"./buttons.css\") layer(framework.components);"},{"type":"header","disableDrag":false,"level":2,"collabId":"81f36b8e-f123-4461-99f8-99fa0a4ac7a6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"级联层的优先级"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"73ed28da-81f3-49c0-9a03-0f8e26f2bc2d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们先讨论不带 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"!important"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的普通声明。级联层 的优先级和级联层"},{"type":"formatted","textGradient":"sunset","bold":true,"text":"第一次"},{"type":"formatted","text":"声明的顺序有关，后声明的 级联层具有更高的优先级。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"42c81b84-6c6e-4f13-b308-54df17eaaa63","collabId":"a6c3d3ba-5c5a-4d2c-8f84-f2dbf7bf9005","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"@layer components {\n  .button {\n    color: blue;\n  }\n}\n\n@layer reset {\n  button {\n    color: green;\n  }\n}\n\n@layer utilities {\n  .text-red {\n    color: red;\n  }\n}\n\n/* 优先级和第一次声明的顺序有关\n   后续声明的同名 layer 不会修改 layer 的优先级 */\n@layer components {\n  .text-pink {\n    color: pink;\n  }\n}\n"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"f271543d-cea9-4920-91d0-01d9429f83b9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"以上声明的优先级顺序为"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"86a6f56b-cde5-4c94-bd3d-ec876f8dda5b","collabId":"9c768a57-abfa-497f-ad53-8daf920fefb9","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"components < reset < utilities"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"8b193846-771f-4453-bb08-23e9089afc1b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"需要注意的是，即使声明的级联层不带样式块，也是有效声明，也会创建一个级联层"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"205f4e17-7ab3-4ecc-ae76-f38d0015fc5f","collabId":"449b9357-fc6b-4908-ac81-bf6035f35980","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"@layer components;\n@layer utilities;"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"c820d460-56c3-4f79-a5f4-44aa3b345050","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个时候就已经确定了级联层的优先级关系"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"97eed964-a4fb-4f8b-b22a-a1c1403db867","collabId":"cb665bc5-f03e-45ff-8ab5-70531d992474","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"components < utilities"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"d4bb4cf7-7260-41a6-9058-9ad108dd9140","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"@import"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 定义的级联层也能定义优先级关系"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"11b709e9-4b4b-4e46-bb9d-bb0787de37f2","collabId":"68286d57-6661-489f-b7a7-cf7ae459a4c7","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"@import url(\"./vendor.css\") layer(vendor);\n@import url(\"./reset.css\") layer(reset);\n\n@layer components {\n  /* ... */\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"51ac104b-e38c-4390-8dbb-3e91745ee247","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果没有其他提前声明，那么顺序就是"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"886f4b87-53cb-46e0-a676-8720a20c50cb","collabId":"e2e5c42c-a133-4544-b985-2694da08fd2c","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"vendor < reset < components"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"60598b4c-7dff-454e-a5db-3987393eea7c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"与级联层内的样式相比，未分层样式具有更高的优先级。也就是说，写在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"@layer"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 外的样式会优先于所有 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"@layer"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 内的样式，与它们出现的先后顺序无关。可以把未分层规则理解为处于当前层级的隐式最终层，位于所有命名层或匿名层之后。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"865d0b01-5f17-4b29-b574-e9df11e8e856","collabId":"a0d67a42-0eed-40b8-96eb-dff99e9470aa","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":".button {\n  color: black;\n}\n\n@layer components {\n  #app .page .button {\n    color: blue;\n  }\n}\n\n@layer utilities {\n  .button {\n    color: red;\n  }\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"29994570-710e-4e04-9cbf-4c87d4530504","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"以上代码定义的优先级是"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"16f5f3f9-1b36-49e2-923e-42d314a86fc7","collabId":"e748babf-183d-46bf-bbf6-588c6d4b5231","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"components < utilities < 未分层样式"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"4994bfe4-5f84-4eda-90b7-f0c3371f8200","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于嵌套级联层，会先比较父级联层的优先级。只有父级联层相同时，才会根据子级联层的声明顺序比较优先级"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"b04e2c28-b15a-4290-8cc5-5b48585c7800","isFold":false,"foldHeight":400,"collabId":"f0395bae-d196-42d7-9f8b-84d2868c241b","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"@layer framework, application;\n\n@layer framework {\n  @layer reset, components;\n\n  @layer reset {\n    .button {\n      color: gray;\n    }\n  }\n\n  @layer components {\n    .button {\n      color: blue;\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n@layer application {\n  @layer base, utilities;\n\n  @layer base {\n    .button {\n      color: green;\n    }\n  }\n\n  @layer utilities {\n    .button {\n      color: red;\n    }\n  }\n}\n"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"2f7ca6d4-c47d-4180-9505-94f51a6c8154","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"以上代码定义的优先级是"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"c6b8816b-9370-4255-a6fc-a7462fa00cac","collabId":"859b08d5-22df-4779-bc74-2be191ce4cd5","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"framework.reset\n<\nframework.components\n<\nframework 自身直接规则\n<\napplication.base\n<\napplication.utilities\n<\napplication 自身直接规则\n<\n顶层未分层规则"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"36af9e2a-c7e3-4f83-80f0-c45ede55849d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们还可以在查询条件中定义级联层，但如果级联层的顺序依赖这些条件规则，不同环境下就可能形成不同的优先级关系。先看下面的代码"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"e5395afb-6f8a-496d-b673-87b9f15daf24","collabId":"1d0c22d4-a679-4912-a8e2-f2db149834c0","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"@media (min-width: 800px) {\n  @layer layout {\n    /* ... */\n  }\n}\n\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n  @layer theme {\n    /* ... */\n  }\n}\n\n@layer theme, layout;"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"c9424600-e0e7-4e89-adf9-db73c826bcfc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这段代码在不同环境下会形成不同的级联层顺序："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"7122ef17-b831-48c5-973e-8168c68244b6","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"e429f33d-85f8-402c-a278-849dea5ce10e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"1853f41a-85b9-4882-8eb7-c4587252756c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当宽屏条件成立时，源码中最先参与层顺序建立的是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"layout"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，因此顺序为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"layout < theme"},{"type":"formatted","text":"；"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"bab79945-c17a-4b24-8c69-ff36927a9062","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"7886703f-6ef6-405f-b650-be508a079929","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当宽屏条件不成立、深色模式条件成立时，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"theme"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 最先参与层顺序建立，因此顺序为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"theme < layout"},{"type":"formatted","text":"；"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"b424fef3-20d2-4fbc-99ca-34f7834c1e38","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"3685f0b7-52ce-4407-8921-5537b547d204","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当两个条件都不成立时，最后的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"@layer theme, layout"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 决定顺序，因此仍是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"theme < layout"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"729174bc-2465-465f-ab0b-940f0e256bf1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"也就是说，查询条件是否成立可能影响级联层第一次参与级联的位置，进而改变层的优先级关系。为了让级联层的优先级不受运行环境影响，我们应该提前确定好级联层的创建顺序，也就是把 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"@layer theme, layout"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的声明放在最上面。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"b06eb458-f72b-4715-a287-86e569d82349","collabId":"c28dacc8-f3ed-43f6-b522-cfb47bcddbac","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"@layer theme, layout;\n\n@media (min-width: 800px) {\n  @layer layout {\n    /* ... */\n  }\n}\n\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n  @layer theme {\n    /* ... */\n  }\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"cf10a576-fcb6-48cc-9c7e-1b9af867cfc6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不管查询条件是否满足，级联层的优先级永远是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"theme < layout"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"collabId":"cc6f5ee1-6ea5-4eb0-8b06-234f7cc947c0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"浏览器优先级判定"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"5b4ebdeb-0ca2-492a-8059-127eac7981a9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"前面的示例只比较了级联层。实际应用中，级联层只是浏览器决定最终样式的其中一个环节。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"fa098005-ee49-4ec1-8e77-fc30ebf4f6b8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"现在我们整体看下浏览器是如何最终决定一个元素的样式的，以及级联层优先级在什么时候考虑。"}]},{"type":"highlight-block","color":"orange","collabId":"6f174652-0252-4b72-8147-7f069fab10d3","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"7bd2041b-c186-4911-be52-548caddd2d73","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为了便于理解，下面只讨论常见的普通作者样式，不覆盖 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"transition"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"animation"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"@scope"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 等特殊情况。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"fb09f0f4-b72c-4f00-95b7-9fb1a12adaf9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果有多个冲突的样式选中了同一个元素，浏览器会按照如下顺序来决定最终样式："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","collabId":"a2f3c04d-560b-45fc-9dbc-584a1edd595d","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"3d291f22-96fe-413a-b70f-6a935c7dd3d5","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"34118255-7817-443c-9f79-118cf89be430","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"来源"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"77aad38a-e578-494e-aec3-3796c7b424da","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先样式的来源可以分为三类"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"b21fc488-497c-459a-a8a4-3a1e5ad62f85","collabId":"fc93f05a-dbd9-4461-93ab-f425e9e805c5","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"Author Origin      网站作者样式\nUser Origin        用户为了满足阅读需求而要求浏览器额外应用的 CSS，实际开发中较少直接接触\nUser-Agent Origin  浏览器默认样式"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"5095eb99-66e8-42c4-9f47-f182c37b11e0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于普通声明，Origin 的优先级是 Author Origin > User Origin > User-Agent Origin。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"e82df10b-c2bc-4350-8b63-9956e450d2c0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"浏览器先看样式的 Origin 来自哪里，在发生冲突时，根据 Author Origin > User Origin > User-Agent Origin 决定哪个胜出"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"ea32e2c2-44d3-46c2-a88c-54541f58bbbb","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"bbe9bb02-d120-4744-8d3b-79032854844e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"封装上下文"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"662a70d6-de74-4a84-a410-6a13014e3881","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"此条规则适用于 Shadow DOM 的场景，比如对于一个 Web Component"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"675220b1-65d9-46ca-bdd9-2181bd2d8d41","collabId":"ebefe2f3-2e1e-46e5-b7c0-3de8fee40445","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"<x-button></x-button>"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"307fb61e-7364-4fe3-b011-cdd8278c4056","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有两个样式都选中了此按钮"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"d0a304bd-f7d1-4292-bdcc-571e4492e274","collabId":"72e3a469-36ad-4093-8898-4a2e24faa0e6","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"/* Shadow DOM 内部 */\n:host {\n  color: blue;\n}\n\n/* 外部页面 */\nx-button {\n  color: red;\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"72798c20-6150-4bba-be75-8970ba204825","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"它们来自于不同的封装上下文，规范规定外部上下文优先，因此外部页面可以方便地覆盖组件为 host 设置的默认值"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"479ef63c-aadc-41b0-95d2-93c416979222","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"cb023d2a-089b-46fd-87df-d7fc2565442c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"内联样式"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"2a570560-6678-45a5-9f67-d7d0ec15b3f4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"是否是通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"style=\"\""},{"type":"formatted","text":" 直接定义的内联样式，内联样式具有更高的优先级"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"97e286f3-6d6c-435b-a0a9-018abc7dce22","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"58bf9be0-b0aa-44f1-8822-d42a76d7b90e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"级联层"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"95e0fe43-dd83-41b6-8563-95a030469c04","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"然后才是我们上述讨论的级联层优先级比较。对于普通声明，后声明的级联层获胜"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"5dc429e4-38c6-4c98-b16d-4267fe16ddd7","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"9c22a596-995f-47b6-b637-288966194cbb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"选择器权重"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"c060b420-2ae8-43fc-b118-fe39e7eb24ce","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果位于同一级联层，那么就得看选择器的权重，权重高的获胜"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"a4754dd3-f4eb-4740-b597-7e81275e5c4b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"55a7b196-a0bc-46b1-8060-c7ea7240cffa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"源码顺序"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"7a8b5f97-7453-4484-9a50-6c64f8a4138d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果权重也相同，那么就看在源码中出现的顺序，出现在后面的样式优先级高于出现在前面的"}]}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"collabId":"a3e26a57-86f3-4332-9572-bc70a0e13900","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"!important 的优先级反转"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"12c07002-3bf4-4ee8-9175-9c9bd458c30c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"以上优先级的讨论都是基于非 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"!important"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的讨论。我们知道 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"!important"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以将优先级强行提到最高，它的优先级比较发生在正常样式比较之前。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"29cc88cf-c6c4-437e-99c9-c2c5e2893750","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是如果有多个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"!important"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的样式发生了冲突，优先级是怎样呢，和上面的优先级是一样的吗？答案是部分优先级会发生反转。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"f68a0b2d-be53-4d09-acf7-6951dae1f956","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先，浏览器比较的顺序没有发生变化，依旧是如下流程"}]},{"type":"numbered-list","collabId":"8d127e8e-bc27-4c8e-b038-32726f3ff361","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"cbdb384f-ddf1-4a05-8c29-4e1162b2e2a8","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"1421eeaf-2754-4d35-aee7-907a36436834","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"来源"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"bba59acc-8541-4974-b7d8-0eeefa29ffa9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"多个冲突的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"!important"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 样式，优先级是 Author Origin < User Origin < User-Agent Origin。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"5443a1e4-e933-4d0f-87da-601b8117d061","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"也就是说浏览器定义的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"!important"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 样式优先级最高，没有办法可以将其覆盖，一个真实的例子，Firefox 对于全屏元素包含类似规则"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"1be79e6d-850e-4b37-ad8f-2ee6338f267d","collabId":"cf84636c-1af7-4ed0-aad2-a1bed80b0d4b","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":":fullscreen:not(:root) {\n  position: fixed !important;\n  inset: 0 !important;\n  width: 100% !important;\n  height: 100% !important;\n  margin: 0 !important;\n  min-width: 0 !important;\n  max-width: none !important;\n  min-height: 0 !important;\n  max-height: none !important;\n  box-sizing: border-box !important;\n  transform: none !important;\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"28258abd-ff95-47ae-b4ff-04d7e9ff1115","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果页面尝试通过修改全屏元素的样式，是不生效的"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"985f2434-c3a5-444d-bc51-566a14eb246a","collabId":"ee1a73d4-ec1f-4335-85c2-044b42f6c6af","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"video:fullscreen {\n  position: absolute !important;\n  width: 300px !important;\n  margin: 100px !important;\n}"},{"type":"highlight-block","color":"blue","collabId":"6306d313-d727-4f39-9a22-b852577229a5","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"1c7736e7-14c2-4e71-9620-80b3ed36f54c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"实际上，根据规范，CSS Transition 样式的优先级是最高的，从技术上讲并非不可覆盖 UA "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"!important"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 样式，但不建议作为覆盖 UA 行为的方法。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"1fcbd43b-0fc8-4dac-9a76-e94cdda2d57f","collabId":"56cd014c-9728-427e-a32d-7bccf5b78780","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"CSS Transition >\nUA !important >\nUser !important >\nAuthor !important >\nCSS Animation >\nAuthor normal >\nUser normal >\nUA normal >"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"b3f36b63-a397-45f1-ac85-e0d7e9a05596","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"5ab29925-4158-4771-ad87-13ca2b77bf5d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"封装上下文"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"aeba8cdd-e832-4044-9f75-79284d3e1ade","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"内层的样式大于外层的样式"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"4fce8e56-fc8f-4eb7-973b-16f95a7ff3b2","collabId":"b4a7ef7c-56ac-4656-b590-82d9c787edd6","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"/* Shadow DOM 内部 */\n:host {\n  color: blue !important;\n}\n\n/* 外部页面 */\nx-button {\n  color: red !important;\n}"}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"e7739e15-7c26-4732-87a9-cf64f7ec510e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"8bfd7884-aa1a-49bf-8918-2ff9ee197700","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"内联样式"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"6ab1d26a-0dcf-4fa1-a86c-4deff2533c15","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这里没有变化，因为在这一层没有内部比较的优先级"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"c548b754-c432-478a-ba43-8ed675681dda","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"aea0ef29-7eff-42ad-94d9-d83bdf69d3cd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"级联层"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"e9b70e5c-e5e4-4a57-a942-319ef6db9524","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"级联层的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"!important"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 样式优先级发生了反转，先声明的级联层的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"!important"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 样式优先级高于后声明的级联层样式"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"d24fe0d5-004f-4bc7-88b0-5f43be5e6cd4","collabId":"743ef9de-9573-4d04-8eb0-59ac958caa68","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"@layer reset, components, utilities;\n\n@layer reset {\n  .button {\n    color: red !important;\n  }\n}\n\n@layer utilities {\n  #app .page .button {\n    color: blue !important;\n  }\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"f181b94c-c7fe-4119-af34-74ce4e4f2d9b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"!important"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的样式优先级是"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"57f22f96-e8f7-4c15-9366-4889a4a7df97","collabId":"97bc005e-afb3-4748-a701-23db60c65a54","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"reset > components > utilities > 未分层"}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"188056dc-07b5-4b0a-82e4-f98621a8449d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"07f26160-a550-4ac8-8ab1-7b291f6985c0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"选择器权重"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"e9cc8366-017d-4c03-8e35-c89c6c1be58a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这里优先级顺序没有反转，权重高的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"!important"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 样式优先级依旧高于权重低的"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"9ef8d9a5-0746-4595-a183-bdf9667a0589","collabId":"f6fcc0cc-2b21-46aa-ba03-5e46799c4e47","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"@layer components {\n  #app .button {\n    color: blue !important;\n  }\n\n  .button {\n    color: red !important;\n  }\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"d94ed2c3-e186-4f10-b2b7-d31f84a66b74","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最终生效的是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"color: blue !important;"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"f3a54bd5-4afe-4bf3-84a6-7a6781f63e74","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"7c407867-f448-450f-8c49-80af9186dd33","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"源码顺序"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"e7a3407b-4e74-444a-b0c3-b86b0a1f956a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这部分的优先级也没有反转，相同权重，出现后面的样式优先级依旧高于前面的"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"33f09da8-b5b4-4272-944b-4a5f4fda23d9","collabId":"38510e82-7a8e-4d91-b081-25a6fbd7db70","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"@layer components {\n  .button {\n    color: blue !important;\n  }\n\n  .button {\n    color: red !important;\n  }\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"d646e07e-a026-4ed7-8d1d-123da9daa4cd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最终生效的是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"color: red !important;"}]}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"collabId":"ad5a6681-7082-4281-b8e7-31a02417d6c4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"revert-layer"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"59606f96-f90c-412a-9dcc-64b8637fd48e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"CSS 引入了一个新的"},{"type":"content-link","refId":381,"contentId":323,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","collabId":"6c6e3072-97ec-4038-b6cc-b965b65ea981","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"全局关键字"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"revert-layer"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"initial"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"inherit"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"unset"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"revert"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 一样，可以作为几乎任何 CSS 属性的完整值，它的作用是忽略当前级联层对这个属性的贡献，重新从更低优先级的层开始计算，让高层级的级联层放弃控制权。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"fe81a38e-7f66-45f2-a39b-e6a64b4c5889","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"revert"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 会撤销当前 Origin 对该属性的影响，并从优先级更低的 Origin 重新进行级联。例如，作者样式中的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"revert"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 会继续考虑用户样式和浏览器默认样式。"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"revert"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是按 Cascade Origin 回滚，而 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"revert-layer"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以理解为按 Cascade Layer 回滚。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"68b1a74e-f035-4da9-a616-6cbb62384d1f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"假设有四层级联层"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"0aced3d2-1fbc-4f54-8149-8c6af0505115","collabId":"19707f67-2ed2-44b2-a458-9c1de9160803","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"@layer reset, base, components, utilities;"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"2b28f6fe-6249-4b66-9ab9-c5bb359acc65","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"正常的优先级是"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"b1e18d10-9f7d-4f84-862f-dd5dd4e04f77","collabId":"07636482-2c60-4ec1-a9cf-cd19665754a8","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"reset < base < components < utilities"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"c0407a25-5cb2-40e6-9063-28dc01af31af","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有如下样式"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"a67d9f48-4ee7-43d8-a7eb-ee561d531526","collabId":"44b1be25-08f6-4bbd-b991-2bf82f50cbe4","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"@layer reset {\n  button {\n    color: black;\n  }\n}\n\n@layer base {\n  button {\n    font-family: system-ui;\n  }\n}\n\n@layer components {\n  .button {\n    color: white;\n    background: royalblue;\n  }\n}\n\n@layer utilities {\n  .text-red {\n    color: red;\n  }\n\n  .restore-component-color {\n    color: revert-layer;\n  }\n}"},{"type":"code-block","language":"HTML","uuid":"bfc111d2-24f5-489c-a7f9-9ec2cb3c513d","collabId":"48cac4ea-2233-43d7-a37b-7415805c87be","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"<button class=\"button text-red restore-component-color\">\n  Save\n</button>"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"cbdb1588-ae7f-49ae-af99-7fbb61ebb59f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"根据我们上面的级联层规则，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"utilities"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 内部的"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"5dde5d20-35c7-400b-814e-c3f11b8285a1","collabId":"f36ad7a1-54d2-4e8a-93b5-a1ba37e98e0c","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":".restore-component-color {\n  color: revert-layer;\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"66bbf941-acc8-4a4b-a719-820343a7de89","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"优先级最高，赢得了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"color"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的竞争，它取值为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"revert-layer"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，就是告诉浏览器，重新计算 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"color"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的样式，忽略当前级联层为该元素声明的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"color"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，也就是说，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"utilities"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 级联层的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":".text-red"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"color"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的声明会被一并忽略。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"c259b871-7a75-4072-8359-d80e98388d20","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"revert-layer"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 会忽略当前声明所在级联层对该属性的影响，并继续按照当前 Origin 和重要性级别，寻找更低优先级的级联结果。也就是"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"60a2a349-627d-400c-898f-ac6e12be7507","collabId":"85cf2f1e-d17c-4c36-afe3-422cf37d51e6","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"@layer components {\n  .button {\n    color: white;\n  }\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"ad297e72-a6a7-4832-aaea-385f2f1815a2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"需要注意的是，这里不是回退到上一层，而是回退到上一个优先级比较低的级联样式"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"df311224-9d8b-42d2-baf4-b9cbfce44198","collabId":"a4478650-d503-4134-a915-7c42a0f743ec","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"@layer reset, base, components, utilities;\n\n@layer reset {\n  .button {\n    color: black;\n  }\n}\n\n@layer base {\n  /* 没有设置 color */\n}\n\n@layer components {\n  /* 没有匹配 .button 的 color */\n}\n\n@layer utilities {\n  .button {\n    color: revert-layer;\n  }\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"e19d8a93-8847-4fd1-ba9b-5497db1dcbe9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于如上情况，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"components"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"base"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 都没有设置 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"color"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 样式，那么就会回退到"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"895e5579-17bc-43e3-bba1-e42cefda9a6a","collabId":"e5c7e72b-b564-498e-9bc4-e538e9d30a3b","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"@layer reset {\n  .button {\n    color: black;\n  }\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"c11b2620-dea4-4d9c-8b50-c912b7d0abf4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以，如果当前 Origin 和重要性级别中不存在更低优先级的级联层声明，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"revert-layer"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可能继续回退到其他 Origin；在这种情况下，它的结果可能与 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"revert"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 相同，但两者的语义仍然不同。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"7b0bd310-962c-4971-b653-bac36364e0f4","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"revert-layer"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 并不是简单地回退到当前父层的下一个子层，而是继续沿整个级联层树寻找更低优先级的可用结果。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"0ba2d7b6-03e4-4b67-9696-25ff2d9fa64f","collabId":"0ae944d0-8788-49be-be5b-cbd571435fb6","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"@layer framework, application;\n\n@layer framework {\n  .target {\n    color: blue;\n  }\n}\n\n@layer application {\n  @layer base, components;\n\n  @layer base {\n    .target {\n      color: revert-layer;\n    }\n  }\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"09869211-b811-41d5-8167-cc01aa3cc275","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"application.base"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"application"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 内部最低的子层，但它并不是整个 Author Origin 的最低层。退出 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"application.base"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 后，浏览器仍可能找到更低优先级的顶层父层，因此，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"application.base"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"revert-layer"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 会回退到 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"framework"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的声明"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"37fe91c0-cf0c-4e49-a16b-aa8d2de74088","collabId":"02d8a101-8e69-48b3-876c-728a0ebf739f","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"@layer framework {\n  .target {\n    color: blue;\n  }\n}"},{"type":"header","level":2,"collabId":"43807706-dabd-4832-b957-39fb56e19a2c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"工程实践"}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"collabId":"1ec130aa-edd9-4c60-bde7-bac44de0b33b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在顶部入口集中声明顺序"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"0aa688b8-bea2-4223-a0b8-7a7fd8b088dc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"推荐在入口文件中集中声明顺序"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"c805d923-8cac-49d3-a054-6ff3c0e97f3e","collabId":"13a2bf62-cb3c-48ca-8d36-3d2b05944e1c","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"@layer reset, vendor, tokens, base, components, utilities, overrides;"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"4b61d580-bdfb-41e7-b869-7183a75b57bc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不要让每个文件自己首次创建级联层，否则级联层的顺序就会依赖于文件的加载顺序"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"835b84cc-3889-4e17-a203-83d444c7bc66","collabId":"e6440979-dd5a-4932-bbf8-7c40525bb720","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"/* a.css */\n@layer components {\n}\n\n/* b.css */\n@layer reset {\n}"},{"type":"header","level":3,"collabId":"27b3a03f-f6d3-4263-8045-89caba860dfd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"三方库 !important 样式的覆盖"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"78d37c4a-e919-4823-834f-7977b424d5b3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为了能够覆盖三方库的样式，我们一般会将应用层的样式声明在后面"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"82c5ee6a-f4c7-4825-ae7f-25ff1610b2f5","collabId":"3cfabd80-9d7d-4a7c-9094-eb86077bc420","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"@layer vendor, application;\n\n@import url(\"./vendor.css\") layer(vendor);"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"ad35c7fe-bd93-403e-bf06-f28c2bbb1dec","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但对于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"!important"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 规则中 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"vendor > application"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，无法在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"application"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这个级联层覆盖 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"vendor"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"!important"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 样式，对于这种情况，我们可以在最前方加上一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"important-overrides"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 级联层"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"fc230a54-afff-4bd4-863d-67783dc3fd2d","collabId":"5b15d666-cdfd-46f6-b201-b28afbf2de0f","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"@layer important-overrides, vendor, application;\n\n@layer important-overrides {\n  .btn {\n    color: red !important;\n  }\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"1a493eaf-d476-4e64-9d9a-ab05e379b063","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"并规定只有处理第三方 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"!important"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或关键约束时才能使用它。"}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"collabId":"0d30079f-b3d9-4e10-bc71-c780e7fdaf1f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"命名空间"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"15a55114-ffa9-48f9-92c3-d5db1aeda6cb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"库作者应避免使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"components"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"base"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 等通用的顶层级联层名称"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"aa671f09-e494-45db-88ce-71ba6d009f48","collabId":"39d5c65b-8109-4629-a170-ceedca1f51bc","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"/* 不理想 */\n@layer components;"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"d9deec8e-bbd1-4ba1-b0ea-03a58ad7f6b0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"更建议使用嵌套的命名空间"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"46ffddeb-57ed-4f63-8c8d-53401dc9e70b","collabId":"e8b0fe60-c980-41bf-b99b-3f45e0b35f68","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"@layer acme {\n  @layer reset, tokens, components;\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"3744f110-2158-45b0-b4ad-240d9da45a42","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用库名或其他足够唯一的名称作为顶层命名空间，可以避免和应用层的命名发生冲突，导致同名级联层意外合并。"}]}],"tags":["CSS"],"bannerBg":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/C%3A%5CUsers%5Cpc%5CDesktop%5Cimages%5Cwallhaven-yq2w3x_eae5aa08-e759-4d9a-8e06-64089835abe5.webp","createTime":1784372448576,"updateTime":1789226925040},"meta":{"type":"article","publishTime":1789226925040},"links":{"card:381":{"key":"card:381","type":"card","id":381}}}